// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Sig_Villain1 Var Name - SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P950322630" "<shout>Get the Circle's scrolls quickly. I'll deal with anyone who dares to interrupt."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3843242731" "<shout>I want that amulet, NOW! If not, I'll make lunch out of you!"
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1015553029" "<shout>Make sure all is ready. It would not do for {HeroName} to escape."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1505644828" "<shout>I want Quatrexin's documents. They're in the safe. Hurry up, we ain't got all day!"
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1891797223" "<shout>Recluse may think that I'm getting this medallion for him, but I'm really hoping to wrap my hands around {HeroName}'s throat!"
// SIG_VILLAIN1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P957958702" "<shout>{HeroName} has been a thorn in my side for long enough. It's time to rid the world of this pest."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Sig_Villain1 Var Name - SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3729708534" "Predictable, as always {HeroName}. However, this is where you fall."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2959337690" "Ahh, a quick snack before the long trip back. Excellent."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1773089771" "Now let battle begin, as heroic force is scoured away by the fury of the fallen desert wind."
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P326780951" "Too bad for you I've just had a round of upgrades!"
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2191746590" "Bring it on, {HeroName}! I've been expecting you!"
// SIG_VILLAIN1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3255898524" "The time for battle between minions is over. Now, you will face destruction by my hand!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_SG_PI_Mission_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3660848351" "The Carnival of Shadows is at it again! This time, they're rampaging through Peregrine Island. Looting, arson, you name it, they're pulling it. <color red>Sources say that this is just a distraction from a main objective though, a bank heist, being led by one of Arachnos' elite troops on loan by order of Lord Recluse himself. Be prepared, you may need back-up on this mission.</color> Arachnos troops have been spotted at the bank, so you should head over there right now. You probably have about 5 minutes or less before they make their escape. <br><br><color orange>This is a Safeguard mission. Once you prevent the heist, you will have 15 minutes to explore the area and potentially earn extra rewards before the P.P.D. lock down the area. You can earn extra time by defeating vandals and completing side missions, however you can lose time if they destroy too much of the city.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3776248809" "Protect Peregrine Island bank"
// SendOffString :
"P1334136747" "It looks like the Carnies had everything planned out except for one element: Malta Group Operatives have come out of nowhere to take the streets. I'm concerned that they're hunting any heroes who try to respond. Stop the Carnies and Malta as much as you can, and the streets will be safe once again.<br><br><color orange>Periodically, vandals will arrive to destroy parts of the city. You will see a message when they arrive, and their locations will be displayed in your minimap.</color>"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2895811669" "Go protect Peregrine Island!"
// DeclineString :
"P737905035" "Sorry, can't help you this time."
// DeclineSendOffString :
"P3311727586" "What?! I understand, {HeroName}. You no doubt have some very important things to do. We'll do our best to stop them, but it doesn't look good."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3944548169" "Your priorities are simple, but not easy: Stop the Carnival's rampages and prevent their destructive schemes, and clear the streets of the Malta. Even with this information, you still feel that someone else is involved."

